      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
